    @ (0, 0, 0)\n  District_ProceduralCity3 @ (-156, 0, 0)\n  District_ProceduralCity2
    @ (150, 0, 0)\n  District_ProceduralCity4 @ (0, 0, 245)\n  District_ProceduralCity5
    @ (0, 0, -285)\n  District_ProceduralCity6 @ (-305, 0, 188)\n  District_ProceduralCity7
    @ (311, 0, 198)\n  District_ReichmanUniversity @ (216.9, 0, -170)\n  District_ParkingLot
    @ (216.9, 0, -246)\n  Place_SevenEleven @ (-37, 0.22, -15) yaw 90\xB0\n  Place_PizzaPlace
    @ (-20, 0.15, -100) yaw 0\xB0\n  Place_GasStation @ (320.9, 0, -123.3) yaw 0\xB0\n 
    Place_PoliceStation @ (160, 0, -124.5) yaw 180\xB0\n  Place_PizzaInterior @ (-1000,
    0, 1000)\n  LotCars \u2014 101 parked cars in 101 filled stalls\n  Traffic 142
    street(s) baked (12759 m), 70 lit intersection(s), car pool wired\n\nWARNINGS\n 
    District_ProceduralCity5: 2 texture(s) have no compressed copy and stay RGB24
    \u2014 run The Block \u2192 Compress Textures (TexturesCom_ConcretePlates0211_1_seamless_S)\n 
    District_ProceduralCity6: 4 texture(s) have no compressed copy and stay RGB24
    \u2014 run The Block \u2192 Compress Textures (TexturesCom_ConcretePlates0211_1_seamless_S)\n 
    District_ProceduralCity7: 6 texture(s) have no compressed copy and stay RGB24
    \u2014 run The Block \u2192 Compress Textures (TexturesCom_ConcretePlates0211_1_seamless_S)\n 
    Pizza Place \u2014 stand-in low_poly_pizza_restaurant.glb for pizza-lila.glb:
    lies on its back out of the box; righted and lifted onto the pavement\n  Gas
    Station \u2014 gas-station.glb corrected on import: Sketchfab export imports
    with Y and Z swapped; righted\n\nSTILL BLENDED \u2014 deliberate; suspects if
    anything else renders pale\n  Building Facade.001, CityGenGlass.001, CityGenTCom_DecalsStain0047_1_masked_S,
    CityGenTCom_DecalsStain0057_1_masked_S, CityGenTCom_DecalsStain0094_2_masked_S,
    CityGen_lanes_secondary_color, Material, Material.001, Material.003, SE_glass,
    US_Doors_1, decal_flag, glass\n\nNOTES\n  Ground: sea footprint cut out \u2014
    Unity x [430, 700] z [-546, 54], so wave troughs cannot expose the plate\n  facade
    tint bound to 1 material slot(s)\n  District_FirstOne: 1 collider(s)\n  District_ProceduralCity3:
    stripped 2 baked-car submesh(es) out of 1 merged mesh(es)\n  District_ProceduralCity3:
    alpha-clipped FoliageTrees.001, FoliageTrees.002, FoliageTrees.003, FoliageTrees.004,
    Street_Assets, Street_Assets.001\n  District_ProceduralCity3: filled 1 empty
    material slot(s) \u2014 were rendering magenta\n  District_ProceduralCity3: rebound
    35 texture slot(s) onto compressed copies across 13 material(s)\n  District_ProceduralCity3:
    2 collider(s)\n  District_ProceduralCity2: stripped 2 baked-car submesh(es) out
    of 1 merged mesh(es)\n  District_ProceduralCity2: alpha-clipped FoliageTrees.001,
    FoliageTrees.002, FoliageTrees.003, FoliageTrees.004, Street_Assets, Street_Assets.001\n 
    District_ProceduralCity2: filled 1 empty material slot(s) \u2014 were rendering
    magenta\n  District_ProceduralCity2: rebound 27 texture slot(s) onto compressed
    copies across 10 material(s)\n  District_ProceduralCity2: 2 collider(s)\n  District_ProceduralCity4:
    alpha-clipped FoliageTrees.001, FoliageTrees.002, FoliageTrees.003, FoliageTrees.004,
    Street_Assets, Street_Assets.001, firescape\n  District_ProceduralCity4: filled
    1 empty material slot(s) \u2014 were rendering magenta\n  District_ProceduralCity4:
    rebound 47 texture slot(s) onto compressed copies across 18 material(s)\n  District_ProceduralCity4:
    2 collider(s)\n  District_ProceduralCity5: alpha-clipped FoliageTrees.001, FoliageTrees.002,
    FoliageTrees.003, FoliageTrees.004, Street_Assets, Street_Assets.001, firescape\n 
    District_ProceduralCity5: filled 1 empty material slot(s) \u2014 were rendering
    magenta\n  District_ProceduralCity5: rebound 54 texture slot(s) onto compressed
    copies across 20 material(s)\n  District_ProceduralCity5: 2 collider(s)\n  District_ProceduralCity6:
    alpha-clipped FoliageTrees.001, FoliageTrees.002, FoliageTrees.003, FoliageTrees.004,
    Street_Assets, Street_Assets.001, firescape\n  District_ProceduralCity6: filled
