    rebound 86 texture slot(s) onto compressed copies across 21 material(s)\n  District_ProceduralCity6:
    3 collider(s)\n  District_ProceduralCity7: alpha-clipped FoliageTrees.001, FoliageTrees.002,
    FoliageTrees.003, FoliageTrees.004, Street_Assets, Street_Assets.001, firescape\n 
    District_ProceduralCity7: filled 1 empty material slot(s) \u2014 were rendering
    magenta\n  District_ProceduralCity7: rebound 126 texture slot(s) onto compressed
    copies across 24 material(s)\n  District_ProceduralCity7: 4 collider(s)\n  District_ReichmanUniversity:
    11 collider(s)\n  District_ParkingLot: 2 collider(s)\n  Place_SevenEleven: 76
    collider(s), 2 skipped\n  Place_PizzaPlace: hid collision proxies Collider, Collider_Collider_0\n 
    Place_PizzaPlace: hideNodes skipped \u2014 they name the original model's parts\n 
    Place_PizzaPlace: 4 collider(s)\n  Place_GasStation: rebound 7 texture slot(s)
    onto compressed copies across 3 material(s)\n  Place_GasStation: 39 collider(s),
    60 skipped\n  Place_PoliceStation: 35 collider(s)\n  Place_PizzaInterior: 1 collider(s)\n 
    Place_PizzaInterior: 3 lamps, left on (URP culls them)\n  Place_PizzaInterior:
    door at (-28, 0, -100) r2.5, spawn (-1000, 0.3, 1002.8)\n  LotCars: rebound 292
    texture slot(s) onto compressed copies across 6 material(s)\n  traffic graph:
    97 node(s), 142 street(s)\n  traffic network: 142 street(s), 12759 m of centreline,
    6590 samples at 2 m, 2 height spike(s) flattened\n  traffic lights: 70 lit intersection(s),
    233 pole(s), 26 s cycle\n  traffic cars: 3 model(s) pooled, 2 fuel stop(s)\n 
    navigation: kept the previous bake (2 group(s) re-attached) \u2014 run Build
    World + NavMesh to redo it"
